WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.434
-Enjoy yourself. Enjoy yourself.

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.868
Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.367
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:09.334
This is so exciting.

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.934
The former First Lady,
Michelle Obama is my guest

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:13.234
tonight on the show!

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:16.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.100
Oh, my goodness.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.801
Earlier today, I texted Michelle
and I got a message that said,

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:23.033
"We're sorry. The number
you reached is totally made up."

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:29.033
It must be weird for Michelle
to not be running for president

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:30.801
and have no interest
in running for president

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:33.601
but also be outpolling everyone
who wants to be president.

00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:35.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:40.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.501
She's here to promote
her new book called

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.300
"The Light We Carry."

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.767
It's about how we all
have light within us.

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:49.000
And it's also about
how Joe Biden spent eight years

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.767
walking around with
his iPhone flashlight on.

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:53.000
It's like, "I can't -- I don't
know how to turn it off.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.767
Jill! Jill! How do I --"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:58.033
Well, let's get to some news.

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.534
President Biden
and the First Lady

00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:01.434
just released
their tax returns,

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:04.367
which show that they made
less money than the year before.

00:01:06.067 --> 00:01:08.467
When he heard, Biden
was like, "Friggin' Biden."

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:13.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:15.901
Biden's tax returns
were pretty interesting.

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.167
Under "gifts received,"

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.334
he wrote "nowhere near
what Clarence Thomas got."

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:21.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:23.934
-Goodness!

00:01:23.934 --> 00:01:25.834
-Then under "dependents,"
Biden wrote,

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:27.701
"I only wear them when I know
I won't be near a bathroom."

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:31.133
-Ohhh!
-That's too much information.

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:34.067
That's too much information.
TMI.

00:01:34.067 --> 00:01:35.767
Some news from overseas --

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:37.767
Kim Jong-un said
that North Korea's

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:41.834
first military spy satellite
is ready for launch.

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.968
Keep in mind,
a North Korean spy satellite

00:01:43.968 --> 00:01:45.634
is just a GoPro
on a tennis ball.

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:49.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:51.567
Yeah, it would be like that
remote control helicopter

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:53.267
you got for Christmas,
you know?

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:55.367
Give it five minutes before it
gets stuck in a tree, you know?

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:57.601
Ah, forget it.
Some business news --

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:59.167
I saw that Google
is about to release

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:01.634
their first ever foldable phone.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:03.133
Yep. The phone is amazing.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:05.501
They say it folds faster
than Fox News in court.

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:08.634
-Hey! Ohh! Come on!

00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:12.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:14.067
Ka-ching!

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.467
-You guys see this?
According to a LinkedIn report,

00:02:17.467 --> 00:02:20.434
Amazon is the best company
in the U.S. to work for.

00:02:20.434 --> 00:02:23.367
[ Audience murmuring ]

00:02:23.367 --> 00:02:25.334
Every Amazon employee was like,
"I love it here"

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.934
then blinked
the Morse code for "help."

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:32.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.133
Amazon is actually a great place
to work, unless you're a box.

00:02:35.133 --> 00:02:37.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.868 --> 00:02:40.133
Happy Mother's Day.

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:41.300
Some entertainment news --

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.033
Netflix announced that
in the coming months

00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:47.300
they will roll out paid password
sharing in the U.S.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.934
Paid password sharing?
[ Audience boos ]

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:50.434
Yeah, because that's what
everyone wants to do.

00:02:50.434 --> 00:02:52.300
Pay their ex 12 bucks a month.
Right?

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:54.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.067 --> 00:02:55.534
Some more entertainment news --

00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:57.701
I read that HBO
just started casting

00:02:57.701 --> 00:03:00.601
their new TV series
reboot of "Harry Potter."

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:01.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:03.467
Believe it or not,
we actually got a sneak peek

00:03:03.467 --> 00:03:05.434
at some of the choices
that they've made.

00:03:05.434 --> 00:03:06.801
Check these out.
In the reboot,

00:03:06.801 --> 00:03:08.434
Harry Potter will be played
by

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:09.501
Jorge Santos.

00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:14.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.133 --> 00:03:16.200
Next up, Lucius Malfoy
will be played

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.534
by Marjorie Taylor Greene.

00:03:17.534 --> 00:03:21.133
[ Laughter, cheers ]

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:23.434
Here's another. Voldemort
will be played by

00:03:23.434 --> 00:03:24.734
Jeff Bezos.

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:27.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:29.300
Mr. Ollivander
will be played by

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.968
Bernie Sanders.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.968 --> 00:03:34.334
Here's another. Mad-Eye Moody
will be played by

00:03:34.334 --> 00:03:35.634
Rudy Giuliani.

00:03:35.634 --> 00:03:37.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:40.234
Of course, Peter Pettigrew
will be played by

00:03:40.234 --> 00:03:42.934
Boris Johnson.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.934 --> 00:03:45.167
Here's another.
Madame Maxime will be played

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.434
by Las Vegas Raiders
owner Mark Davis.

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:50.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.367
And finally, Dobby will be
played by

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:55.467
King Charles.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:59.167
I'm excited. I think this is
going to be good, real good.

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:03.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:05.601
Speaking of King Charles,
this is exciting.

00:04:05.601 --> 00:04:09.167
The official dish of his
coronation has been announced,

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:12.133
and it is coronation quiche.
-Mmm!

00:04:12.133 --> 00:04:15.033
-Yep. King Charles actually
released his very own recipe.

00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:16.501
-Really?
-Yeah. Here it is. Step one...

00:04:30.968 --> 00:04:32.634
There you go.
That's the recipe.

00:04:32.634 --> 00:04:33.934
That's how you do it,
huh?

00:04:33.934 --> 00:04:35.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.267 --> 00:04:36.901
Mwah!

00:04:38.567 --> 00:04:40.434
And finally, scientists
in New York

00:04:40.434 --> 00:04:44.767
just discovered a method to
prevent hair from turning gray.

00:04:44.767 --> 00:04:46.267
One guy heard and was like,

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:48.367
"That method is
don't become president."

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:50.300
[ Laughter ]
There you go, everybody.

